    "group": "Breaka Boyz",
    "summary": "When this unit finishes its normal move in your Movement phase, you can pick an enemy unit that it sees no farther than 12\" away. Roll a D6. A 3+ deals the target D3 mortal wounds. Put a Bomb Squig token beside the unit to track the use. Each unit can use this once per turn and twice per battle.",
